CCCL, NVIDIA CUDA headers
-------------------------

Neither is vendored, and that is the point of `csrc/src`'s shims. Where
`examples/flashinfer_probe.rs` reads NVIDIA's `cuda_fp16.h` or FlashInfer's
vendored CCCL from disk, it does so at RUN time, in a probe, to separate "is
this source acceptable to NVRTC" from "is our shim correct". No toolkit text
is carried in this crate's binary and none is redistributed.
